    <string name="covers_explanation">"For comics without a MEGA thumbnail, the app downloads the file once to generate a cover, then deletes that temporary copy. At startup it prepares missing covers in the background, including subfolders of your saved MEGA library. You can keep reading or leave the app. Explicit downloads take priority. Android may pause work for the network, battery or scheduling limits. The bounded cache leaves room for covers you open."</string>
